NNOOTTEESS
     zzllooggiinn is started by ggeettttyy and is not ordinarily run by
     hand: it draws over the whole display and takes the console
     keyboard into raw mode.

     The desktop's driver loading is restricted to the superuser,
     so at present only a root login reaches the desktop; another
     account is authenticated but its session exits at once and
     the login panel returns.
